{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35851","headline":"冬日喜逢吴价 · 李咸用","name":"冬日喜逢吴价","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂杨烟薄井梧空，千里游人驻断蓬。\n志意不因多事改，鬓毛难与别时同。\n莺迁犹待销冰日，鹏起还思动海风。\n穷达他年如赋命，且陶真性一杯中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}